OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day across the
OL,6,Feast and central areas, with some
OL,7,Fpatchy light rain appearing, focused
OL,8,Faround the eastern coastal fringes.
OL,9,FHowever many in the far west staying
OL,10,Fdry and perhaps seeing some limited
OL,11,Fbrightness. Winds light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FEast remaining cloudy with
OL,14,Ffurther patchy light rain. West dry
OL,15,Fwith clear spells, combining with
OL,16,Flight winds bringing frost and the
OL,17,Frisk of fog patches, chiefly to rural
OL,18,Fparts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
