OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FSettled, largely dry fare
OL,6,Fwith bright and sunny spells
OL,7,Fincreasing, but any early mist and fog
OL,8,Fin the west may be slow to burn back.
OL,9,FWinds light.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FMainly cloudy with patchy light rain
OL,13,Ffocused across the east of the area.
OL,14,FWinds light to moderate easterly.
